  "question": {
    "text": "Four closed surfaces and corresponding charge distributions are shown below.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4b7143ea-5b5b-485c-b7d1-e2d58f24945b-1.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 261px;\" /><br /><br />Let the respective electric fluxes through the surfaces be <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>. Then:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FkxNJ",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "I8CpI",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
